{"text":"kuruntokai","n":104,"lines":["அம்ம வாழி தோழி காதலர்","நூலறு முத்தின் தண்சிதர் உறைப்பத்","தாளித் தண்பவர் நாளா மேயும்","பனிபடு நாளே பிரிந்தனர்","பிரியும் நாளும் பலவா குபவே"],"tr":["amma vāḻi tōḻi kātalar","nūlaṟu muttiṉ taṇcitar uṟaippat","tāḷit taṇpavar nāḷā mēyum","paṉipaṭu nāḷē pirintaṉar","piriyum nāḷum palavā kupavē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"காவன் முல்லைப்பூதனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Kāvaṉ Mullaippūtaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 19"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 10, veṇṭaḷai 8"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அம்ம","tr":"amma","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அம்","tr":"am"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ம","tr":"ma"}]},{"text":"வாழி","tr":"vāḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"காதலர்","tr":"kātalar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலர்","tr":"talar"}]}],[{"text":"நூலறு","tr":"nūlaṟu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நூ","tr":"nū"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லறு","tr":"laṟu"}]},{"text":"முத்தின்","tr":"muttiṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முத்","tr":"mut"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தின்","tr":"tiṉ"}]},{"text":"தண்சிதர்","tr":"taṇcitar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தண்","tr":"taṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிதர்","tr":"citar"}]},{"text":"உறைப்பத்","tr":"uṟaippat","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உறைப்","tr":"uṟaip"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பத்","tr":"pat"}]}],[{"text":"தாளித்","tr":"tāḷit","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளித்","tr":"ḷit"}]},{"text":"தண்பவர்","tr":"taṇpavar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தண்","tr":"taṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பவர்","tr":"pavar"}]},{"text":"நாளா","tr":"nāḷā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளா","tr":"ḷā"}]},{"text":"மேயும்","tr":"mēyum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மே","tr":"mē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]}],[{"text":"பனிபடு","tr":"paṉipaṭu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பனி","tr":"paṉi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"படு","tr":"paṭu"}]},{"text":"நாளே","tr":"nāḷē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளே","tr":"ḷē"}]},{"text":"பிரிந்தனர்","tr":"pirintaṉar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிரிந்","tr":"pirin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தனர்","tr":"taṉar"}]}],[{"text":"பிரியும்","tr":"piriyum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிரி","tr":"piri"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"நாளும்","tr":"nāḷum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளும்","tr":"ḷum"}]},{"text":"பலவா","tr":"palavā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பல","tr":"pala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"}]},{"text":"குபவே","tr":"kupavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குப","tr":"kupa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அம்ம","parts":[{"text":"அம்ம","lemma":"அம்ம","gloss":"listen"}],"gloss":"listen"},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"வாழ்","gloss":"live"}],"gloss":"may you live long"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"காதலர்","parts":[{"text":"காதல்","lemma":"காதல்","gloss":"love"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"he (honorific)"}],"gloss":"lover"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நூல்","parts":[{"text":"நூல்","lemma":"நூல்","gloss":"thread"}],"gloss":"thread"},{"surface":"அறு","parts":[{"text":"அறு","lemma":"அறு","gloss":"severed"}],"gloss":"severed"},{"surface":"முத்தின்","parts":[{"text":"முத்து","lemma":"முத்து","gloss":"pearl"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like pearls"},{"surface":"தண்","parts":[{"text":"தண்","lemma":"தண்","gloss":"cool"}],"gloss":"cool"},{"surface":"சிதர்","parts":[{"text":"சிதர்","lemma":"சிதர்","gloss":"drop"}],"gloss":"drops"},{"surface":"உறைப்ப","parts":[{"text":"உறை","lemma":"உறை","gloss":"drip"},{"text":"ப்ப","lemma":"ப்ப","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to drip"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தாளி","parts":[{"text":"தாளி","lemma":"தாளி","gloss":"tāḷi creeper"}],"gloss":"tāḷi creeper"},{"surface":"தண்","parts":[{"text":"தண்","lemma":"தண்","gloss":"cool"}],"gloss":"cool"},{"surface":"பவர்","parts":[{"text":"பவர்","lemma":"பவர்","gloss":"creeper"}],"gloss":"creeper"},{"surface":"நாளா","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"adverbial suffix"}],"gloss":"early in the morning"},{"surface":"மேயும்","parts":[{"text":"மேய்","lemma":"மேய்","gloss":"graze"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"grazing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பனி","parts":[{"text":"பனி","lemma":"பனி","gloss":"dew"}],"gloss":"dew"},{"surface":"படு","parts":[{"text":"படு","lemma":"படு","gloss":"falling"}],"gloss":"falling"},{"surface":"நாளே","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"on the very day"},{"surface":"பிரிந்தனர்","parts":[{"text":"பிரி","lemma":"பிரி","gloss":"separate"},{"text":"ந்த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"past tense"},{"text":"அனர்","lemma":"அனர்","gloss":"he (honorific)"}],"gloss":"he departed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பிரியும்","parts":[{"text":"பிரி","lemma":"பிரி","gloss":"separate"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"separating"},{"surface":"நாளும்","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"days also"},{"surface":"பல","parts":[{"text":"பல","lemma":"பல","gloss":"many"}],"gloss":"many"},{"surface":"ஆகுபவே","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"ப","lemma":"ப","gloss":"future tense marker"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"will indeed become"}]}],"literal":"Listen, may you live, friend! The lover / as cool drops of thread-broken pearls drip, / early in the morning grazing on the cool creeper of tāḷi, / on the very day when dew falls, departed. / The days of separation also will indeed become many.","translation":"Listen, my friend, may you live long! Our lover departed on the very day when dew falls, when beasts graze early in the morning on the cool tāḷi creepers as cool drops like thread-broken pearls drip upon them. The days of his separation, too, will now become many.","modern":"தோழியே, கேள்! நீ வாழ்க! நூல் அறுந்த முத்துக்களைப் போலக் குளிர்ந்த பனித்துளிகள் சிந்த, காலையிலேயே தாளி என்னும் குளிர்ந்த கொடியை விலங்குகள் மேய்கின்ற பனி பொழியும் காலத்தில்தான் நம் காதலர் நம்மைப் பிரிந்து சென்றார். அவர் பிரிந்திருக்கும் நாட்களும் இனிப் பலவாக நீளும் போலிருக்கிறது.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend about the pain of her lover's absence. She recalls the exact season of his departure, which was the cold, dewy season. The imagery of dew drops falling like pearls from a broken thread beautifully captures the fragile, cold atmosphere that mirrors her tears. Animals grazing on the cool tāḷi creepers early in the morning emphasizes the quiet, chilly dawn when he left. She laments that the days of this separation are stretching out and becoming too many to bear.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.2],[1.2,1.62],[1.76,2.6],[2.6,3.0],[3.0,3.44],[3.44,3.68],[3.68,3.92],[3.92,4.16],[4.16,5.6],[5.6,6.5],[6.5,6.6],[6.6,7.2],[7.2,8.1],[8.1,8.4],[8.4,8.8],[8.8,9.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.0],[1.0,1.4],[1.4,1.88],[2.04,3.0],[3.0,3.4],[3.4,3.85],[3.85,4.1],[4.1,4.35],[4.35,4.6],[4.6,6.1],[6.1,7.0],[7.0,7.1],[7.1,7.8],[7.8,8.9],[8.9,9.2],[9.2,9.95],[9.95,10.2]]}}